From: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>
Subject: [PATCH] MIPS: retain built-in module metadata with section GC

Keep modules.builtin populated so built-in crypto is recognized by packaging.

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>

--- a/arch/mips/kernel/vmlinux.lds.S
+++ b/arch/mips/kernel/vmlinux.lds.S
@@ -230,6 +230,9 @@
 		*(.gptab.sbss)
 	}
 
+	/* Keep built-in module metadata with --gc-sections. */
+	.modinfo 0 : { KEEP(*(.modinfo)) }
+
 	/* Sections to be discarded */
 	DISCARDS
 	/DISCARD/ : {
